MODULE 4: Enumeration

Scanning se hume basic information milti hai.

Enumeration us information ko aur deeply collect karti hai.

22. Enumeration kya hai?

Enumeration = Target ke services, users, shares, systems, protocols etc. ke baare mein detailed information gather karna.

Difference:

Scanning → kya available hai?

Enumeration → available cheez ke baare mein detail kya hai?

23. NetBIOS Enumeration

NetBIOS Windows/LAN environment mein communication aur resource sharing se related technology hai.

Enumeration se potentially information mil sakti hai:

Computer names
Domain information
Shares
Network resources

Important ports:

139 → NetBIOS/SMB-related traffic

445 → SMB directly over TCP

24. SMB

SMB = Server Message Block

Windows environments mein file/printer/resource sharing ke liye commonly used.

TCP 445 is an important SMB port.

Enumeration se shares aur related information identify ki ja sakti hai.

25. SNMP Enumeration ⭐

SNMP = Simple Network Management Protocol

Network devices ko monitor/manage karne ke liye use hota hai.

Examples:

Routers
Switches
Servers
Network devices

UDP 161 → SNMP

SNMP environment mein information potentially include kar sakti hai:

Device names
System information
Network information
Configuration-related information
26. SMTP Enumeration

SMTP = Simple Mail Transfer Protocol

Email sending ke liye commonly used.

TCP 25 → SMTP

Enumeration ka purpose mail server/users ke baare mein information identify karna ho sakta hai.

27. LDAP

LDAP = Lightweight Directory Access Protocol

Directory services ke saath interact karne ke liye use hota hai.

Common port:

389 → LDAP

Simple example:

Organization mein users/groups ki directory information manage/access karne ke context mein LDAP use ho sakta hai.

28. DNS Enumeration

DNS enumeration ka purpose organization ke DNS infrastructure aur records ke baare mein information collect karna hai.

Potential information:

DNS servers
IP addresses
Hostnames
Domain-related records

Sir ke notes mein dnsenum bhi mentioned hai.

29. Directory Enumeration

Web server par hidden/interesting directories aur resources identify karne ke liye directory enumeration ki ja sakti hai.

Sir ke material mein tools mentioned hain:

Feroxbuster
Dirb
Gobuster
Dirsearch
30. NTP Enumeration

NTP = Network Time Protocol

Systems ke time synchronization ke liye use hota hai.

UDP 123 → NTP

NTP enumeration se network ke systems/hosts ke baare mein additional information potentially gather ki ja sakti hai.

31. Enumeration ka Overall Flow

Isko exam mein aise yaad rakho:

Target
↓
Footprinting
↓
Scanning
↓
Open Ports
↓
Services
↓
Enumeration
↓
Detailed Information

Example:

Target → Scan → Port 445 → SMB → Enumerate SMB → Shares/host information
